  "title": "Stuffed Zucchini Boats",
  "description": "This recipe for stuffed zucchini boats fills tender zucchini with onion, parsley, bread crumbs, and lots of cheese before baking them. A delicious way to enjoy zucchini!",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-09T20:34:03-04:00",
